[VoxrCommandParser] Pattern "noisy ?a ?b ?c ?d ?e ?f ?g ?h ?i ?j ?k ?l ?m" (intent 'noisy') has 13 optional elements, more than the 12 the eager-flush analysis can expand (it enumerates 2^optionals concrete forms). That analysis is then abandoned for the whole command set, not just this pattern: with eagerFlushOnCompleteMatch on, no command commits early — every complete match is held for prefixHoldSeconds where it is set, and for the full bufferWindow where it is not. Reduce this pattern's optional elements to restore early commit.
